## 송금 서비스

여기서 실제 분산 트랜잭션을 건다.

```java
import org.springframework.transaction.annotation.Transactional;
import org.springframework.stereotype.Service;

@Service
public class TransferService {

    private final WalletRepositoryRouter walletRepositoryRouter;
    private final TransferHistoryRepositoryRouter historyRepositoryRouter;

    public TransferService(WalletRepositoryRouter walletRepositoryRouter,
                           TransferHistoryRepositoryRouter historyRepositoryRouter) {
        this.walletRepositoryRouter = walletRepositoryRouter;
        this.historyRepositoryRouter = historyRepositoryRouter;
    }

    @Transactional
    public void transfer(TransferRequest request) {
        WalletRepositoryPort fromRepository = walletRepositoryRouter.route(request.getFromDb());
        WalletRepositoryPort toRepository = walletRepositoryRouter.route(request.getToDb());

        TransferHistoryRepositoryPort fromHistoryRepository =
                historyRepositoryRouter.route(request.getFromDb());
        TransferHistoryRepositoryPort toHistoryRepository =
                historyRepositoryRouter.route(request.getToDb());

        Wallet fromWallet = fromRepository.findById(request.getFromWalletId())
                .orElseThrow(() -> new IllegalArgumentException("출금 지갑 없음"));

        Wallet toWallet = toRepository.findById(request.getToWalletId())
                .orElseThrow(() -> new IllegalArgumentException("입금 지갑 없음"));

        fromWallet.decrease(request.getAmount());
        toWallet.increase(request.getAmount());

        fromRepository.save(fromWallet);
        toRepository.save(toWallet);

        fromHistoryRepository.save(
                TransferHistory.withdraw(request.getFromWalletId(), request.getAmount(), request.getToDb().name())
        );
        toHistoryRepository.save(
                TransferHistory.deposit(request.getToWalletId(), request.getAmount(), request.getFromDb().name())
        );
    }
}
```

이 메서드는

- DB1 → DB2
- DB1 → DB4
- DB3 → DB2
- DB4 → DB1

모든 케이스를 동일한 코드로 처리할 수 있다.

